Native output (single canonical 3-file surface, folder layout per ChangelogModal / JobProgressDrawer):
  apps/windows/TeslaSync.App/modals-dialogs/Modal/Modal.cs           (WinUI view - Popup overlay)
  apps/windows/TeslaSync.App/modals-dialogs/Modal/Modal.ViewModel.cs (WinUI-free state holder)
  apps/windows/TeslaSync.App/modals-dialogs/Modal/Modal.Model.cs     (WinUI-free size / projection / registration / diagnostics)
